This project is an independent .NET library for Kaspa. Its public types are
named as counterparts of NBitcoin (https://github.com/MetacoSA/NBitcoin).
NKaspa's API design references NBitcoin. NBitcoin is licensed under the MIT
License. Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors / Nicolas Dorier.

NKaspa does not vendor the NBitcoin source tree. One exception:
src/NKaspa/BIP39/english.txt is the BIP39 English wordlist copied from
NBitcoin/BIP39/IWordlistSource.cs. Its MIT notice is
src/NKaspa/BIP39/WORDLIST-LICENSE.txt. Copyright (c) 2023 Metaco SA.

Elliptic-curve operations use the NBitcoin.Secp256k1 NuGet package, which
is also under the MIT License.

BLAKE2b is implemented in this repository from RFC 7693.
Kaspa address encoding follows the cashaddr-style bech32 used by Kaspa
(prefix kaspa, kaspatest, kaspasim, or kaspadev, and an 8-character checksum).
